<p>Roof damage insurance claims in McAllen usually begin with a storm: spring hail, a summer microburst, or heavy rain from a tropical system. The roof is the most expensive single component on many claims, and it is also where insurer and policyholder estimates tend to differ the most. A reliable roof insurance estimate McAllen property owners can stand behind needs accurate measurements, correct materials, and every line item a proper re-roof requires.</p>
<p>Local construction matters here. Most McAllen homes are slab-on-grade with composition shingle roofs, some with clay or concrete tile, and many outbuildings and commercial buildings use metal panels or flat and low-slope membranes. Each roof type fails differently, and each raises different claim questions.</p>

