</tbody>
</table>
<p>Damage caused by hail is covered in more depth on our <a href="/services/hail-damage-claims/">hail damage claims</a> page, and wind-driven damage on our <a href="/services/wind-damage-claims/">wind damage claims</a> page.</p>

<h2>Typical Documentation for a Roof Claim</h2>
<ul>
<li>Date-stamped photos of each roof slope, close-ups of damage, and interior ceiling stains.</li>
<li>Roof measurements (squares, pitch, ridge, valleys, eaves, rakes) and number of layers.</li>
<li>Material details: shingle brand and line, tile profile, metal gauge, or membrane type.</li>
